      "requested_change": "Remove the statement 'This decline proves that COMPANY_11 will be unable to meet its financial obligations in FY2026.' Replace with a factual description of the cash position and cash flow generation, e.g., 'Cash and cash equivalents decreased to $10.7 billion at year-end 2025, though the company generated $52.0 billion in operating cash flow during the year.'"
    }
  ],
  "calibration_concern": null,
  "overall_assessment": "The quantitative claims (C1, C2, C3 percentage calculations) are arithmetically correct based on the cited facts. C1: (21,354 - 25,390) / 25,390 = -15.91% (reported -15.90%, within tolerance). C2: (51,970 - 55,022) / 55,022 = -5.55% (matches). C3: (10,681 - 23,187) / 23,187 = -53.93% (matches). C4 accurately summarizes the earnings driver analysis from EP_0011_E01. The sole material defect is the unsupported forward-looking inference in C3 regarding the company's ability to meet obligations, which is not supported by the evidence and contradicted by the strong operating cash flow generation noted in the same source."
}

